        <activityName xml:lang="en">Heat, at 5 m2 Cu collector, one-family house, for hot water</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heat, at 5 m2 Cu collector, one-family house, for hot water
Use of a solar system excluding the necessary auxiliary heating. The simulation is made for solar collector systems in the city of Zurich. The annual irradiation amounts to 1249 kWh/m2. 65% solar fraction, 30° inclination, 22° southeast orientation.;
UUID: c886cfb3-186b-3bfb-af11-d2a217bc0ccb
Delivery of heat with a solar system including maintenance and electricity use for operation. Excluding the necessary auxiliary heating.
Location: Solar collector system operated in CH.
Technology: Solar collector system for hot water installed on the roof of a house.
Time period: Time of simulation.
Production volume: Total heat delivered by flat plate collectors in CH in 2008 was 213'500 MWh.
Sampling: Own simulation. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c886cfb3-186b-3bfb-af11-d2a217bc0ccb.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
